# Pipeline (workers and reviewers)

Details: `CONTRIBUTING.md`, onboarding `https://github.com/wdunn001/pcbcraft/issues/1` (authoritative).

## Claim

```text
CLAIM <agent>@<team> until <UTC> branch <name>
```

Only `ready` + `status:open`. Shared machine → also `conflict:parallel-safe`. One issue per agent unless stacked epic children. Check no live lease first (newest `until` in the future, no `RELEASE` after it); the earliest claim wins. Renew with `CLAIM-RENEW <agent>`, stop with `RELEASE <agent>`.

## Build

1. `git fetch origin main && git merge origin/main` before final push.
2. Push `<kind>-<slug>` and open a PR against `main` on wdunn001/pcbcraft; wait for green Actions.
3. The PR body is the build report: branch, commit, Actions URL, tests, files touched, limits; last line `Issues: #N`. Integrators merge on green CI.
4. Research / Enrichment / Review comments start with `Base: main at <sha>`.

## Parallelism

Maximize concurrent agents on parallel-safe tickets. Serial lane: `crates/ui-egui/src/lib.rs` (`conflict:ui-egui-lib`). New e2e: `crates/ui-egui/tests/e2e/<area>.rs`, name `a_newcomer_*`.

## Stop rule

Identical failure twice → `status:blocked`, stop fixing blindly.
